      "bullets": [
        "Automated LLM vulnerability scanners are flooding open-source maintainers like SQLite with low-quality, AI-generated CVE reports and false positives.",
        "Security teams using LLMs for automated bug hunting must implement human-in-the-loop validation to avoid submitting unverified security alerts.",
        "Hallucinated vulnerabilities from AI code auditors create maintainer fatigue, highlighting the limits of uncalibrated LLM security analysis."
      ]
